--- !u!114 &9148906931122006549
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5342939055415212090}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c594fa09de6cb4d4bb0264bd4f3cf0c1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialManager: {fileID: 7058351719599369686}
  isJumpOut: 1
  title: Counter Attack
  tutorialPage:
  - sentenceIndex: 
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2c68a0ac29d03be49bd918efc897e8fd, type: 3}
    context: 'Counter Attack 1 - Counter Attack

      Press the RT button to use
      Counter attack, which can reflect enemy projectiles back to deal damage. Qin
      cannot directly cause damage to enemies by Counter attack. Counter attack consume
      Qi.

'
  - sentenceIndex: 
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00dda5def4d97e34e9f2f961cec714b3, type: 3}
    context: "Counter Attack 2 \u2013 Perfect Counter attack\r\nIf Qin uses Counter
      attack just as a projectile is about to hit herself, it will trigger a Perfect
      Counter-Attack. A Perfect Counter attack restores Qi.\r\n"
  - sentenceIndex: 
    image: {fileID: 0}
    context: "Counter Attack 3 \u2013 Wind Force\r\nIf Qin reflects something with
      Counter Attack, her next Counter Attack comes quicker.\r\n"
  - sentenceIndex: 
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd3e358dc90b2664eb578bd56a128165, type: 3}
    context: "Counter Attack 4 \u2013 Aim\r\nThe direction of a reflected projectile
      from Counter attack can be changed as Qin\u2019s will. \nL stick is used for
      simple aiming, while the R stick is used for more precise aiming.\r\n"
